## chart main iOS Release Gate Map
```mermaid
gantt
  title iOS Release Gate Map
  dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat  %b %d

  section P0 Proof
  P0 Local proof          :done, local-proof, 2026-05-01, 1d
  P0 Physical smoke       :crit, physical-smoke, 2026-05-01, 1d

  section P0 Human Gates
  P0 Human Apple step     :crit, apple-step, 2026-05-01, 1d

  section P1 Distribution
  Beta review             :review, after physical-smoke, 2d
  Public link cap         :cap, after review, 1d
  P1 Rollback             :done, rollback, 2026-05-01, 1d
  External invite         :milestone, invite, after cap, 0d
```

## chart local-proof Local Proof
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  build["OK: build passes"]
  fixtures["OK: fixture acceptance passes"]
  screenshots["OK: screenshot dimensions valid"]
  ready["READY: physical smoke can start"]

  build --> fixtures --> screenshots --> ready
```

## chart human-apple-step Human Apple Step
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  need["MANDATORY HUMAN: Apple UI"]
  action["Action: accept agreements / configure ASC fields"]
  proof["Proof: screenshot or checklist tick"]
  resume["Resume: rerun release readiness + attach build"]

  need --> action --> proof --> resume
```

## chart physical-smoke Physical Smoke
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Operator
  participant Phone
  participant App
  participant API

  Operator->>Phone: Unlock device and install TestFlight build
  Operator->>App: Sign in with seeded account
  App->>API: Fetch bootstrap / entitlement / current state
  API-->>App: Return release-state payload
  App-->>Operator: Golden path visible
```

## chart rollback Rollback
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  bad["Bad build detected"]
  disable["Disable public link"]
  remove["Remove build from external group"]
  notify["Notify testers with build number"]
  repair["Repair data or ship fixed build"]

  bad --> disable --> remove --> notify --> repair
```
